WEBVTT

00:57:28.822 --> 00:57:33.650
Thank you so much for coming,
spending this time, opening your heart

00:57:33.674 --> 00:57:36.240
and sharing with us just so much wisdom.

00:57:36.264 --> 00:57:37.419
Thank you.

00:57:37.443 --> 00:57:39.606
EG: Thank you, Chris.
I love talking to you.

00:57:39.630 --> 00:57:43.028
(Music)

00:57:46.469 --> 00:57:50.195
CA: This week's show was produced
by Sharon Mashihi.

00:57:50.219 --> 00:57:54.291
Our associate producer
is Kim Nederveen-Pieterse.

00:57:54.315 --> 00:57:55.971
Special thanks to Helen Walters.

00:57:55.995 --> 00:57:57.760
Our show was mixed by David Herman,

00:57:57.784 --> 00:58:00.249
and our theme music
is by Allison Leyton-Brown.